title: Instructions/find_definition

Where a name is defined: the wikitext definitions of a macro, procedure, function or custom widget, marking the one the wiki imports for everyone, and the running ~JavaScript behind a widget, filter operator, run prefix or macro:

```
find_definition(name="list-links")
find_definition(name="$list")
```

See [[find_definition]] for parameters and output.
